      "capturedBy": null,
      "url": null,
      "text": "Visual inspection of the door laid against the workshop wall. Widespread paint loss across all painted wood: both stiles, all four rails, the glazing bar, the base mouldings, and especially the five lower panel boards. Wood beneath the paint is greyed and weathered; surface fibres are open on the lower panel boards with visible splits and gaps between boards. The upper hinge leaf shows surface oxidation. Both glass panes appear structurally intact but are heavily soiled with a calcareous deposit / old paint overspray. No fractures observed in the glass.",
